1
00:01:33,130 --> 00:01:38,110
[First Love Again]

2
00:01:38,390 --> 00:01:40,960
[Episode 9]

3
00:01:45,470 --> 00:01:48,200
[Oulebao Water World]

4
00:01:45,600 --> 00:01:47,060
Watch your step. This way.

5
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:51,060
[Entrance]

6
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:50,080
Hello, excuse me.

7
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:52,360
Isn't the Water World Anime Expo

8
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,890
supposed to start at 10:00?

9
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,690
Why is there no one here?

10
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:57,840
The Anime Expo is on the 19th.

11
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,200
Today is the 16th.

12
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,400
The event is on the 19th?

13
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:02,680
Yes.

14
00:02:02,190 --> 00:02:04,970
[Entrance]

15
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:04,880
Oh no. She probably hasn't left yet.

16
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,520
Xiaotao,

17
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,919
you haven't left yet, right?

18
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:09,720
Where are you?

19
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,480
I'm right behind you.

20
00:02:13,830 --> 00:02:16,410
[Oulebao Water World]

21
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,890
Oh no.

22
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:19,990
[Oulebao Water World]

23
00:02:23,560 --> 00:02:24,890
I've never swum before.

24
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,920
How do you swim?

25
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,920
Don't worry.

26
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,520
You're just too nervous.

27
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,960
If you're nervous,
just relax and breathe, okay?

28
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,520
Just relax and breathe.

29
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:36,840
Where are the others?

30
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,320
Yes, don't be nervous.

31
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:41,320
Chen Yu and Zhou Yunze have been
having issues lately.

32
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:44,280
Kong Fang suddenly said he had
a stomachache this morning.

33
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,240
Everyone bailed at the last minute.

34
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:46,900
These people are unreliable.

35
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:50,000
But for such a big Water World Anime Expo,

36
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:53,050
why haven't I seen a single billboard?

37
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:56,520
Maybe it's inside.

38
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,120
Look at the time.

39
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,720
Why is there hardly anyone here?

40
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:03,720
Maybe it's still early.

41
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,400
People haven't come in yet.

42
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:06,920
There'll be people later.

43
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,000
Li Sirui,

44
00:03:13,170 --> 00:03:15,030
are you hiding something from me?

45
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:18,180
What could I possibly hide from you?

46
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,690
Change your clothes first.

47
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:45,460
Our event has been postponed.

48
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,650
Xiaotao, our event has been canceled.

49
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,380
Neither works.

50
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,420
Li Sirui, what are you looking at?

51
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:28,600
Nice shoes.

52
00:04:36,930 --> 00:04:38,320
Li Sirui.

53
00:04:40,450 --> 00:04:42,409
[Sifang Heyi Restaurant]

54
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,480
Le Xiaotao.

55
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,909
Didn't you say you wanted to eat

56
00:04:43,909 --> 00:04:45,710
Kunzhou food from our hometown?

57
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,920
You stood me up again.

58
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,580
Fine, I'll eat alone then.

59
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,050
Hello. How many for you?

60
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,520
One.

61
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,860
It's a bit crowded. Please wait a moment.

62
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,840
Hello. How many for you?

63
00:04:58,840 --> 00:04:59,920
I made a reservation.

64
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:00,720
Ms. Wan.

65
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:03,500
Okay. One moment, please.

66
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,640
Aren't you the classmate
who came to our house

67
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,370
to take care of Gu Han last time?

68
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:15,040
Hello, ma'am.

69
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,490
Waiting for a table?

70
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,440
Join me.

71
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:21,120
I'm dining alone anyway.

72
00:05:21,640 --> 00:05:22,320
Let's go.

73
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,880
Come in, have a seat.

74
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,360
Dear,

75
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:44,920
I was in such a rush last time

76
00:05:44,920 --> 00:05:47,050
that I didn't even get to ask your name.

77
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,840
My name is Zhou Xiangxiang.

78
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:49,960
Zhou Xiangxiang.

79
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,640
Don't be shy, dig in.

80
00:06:00,680 --> 00:06:01,440
Xiangxiang,

81
00:06:02,440 --> 00:06:04,600
how did you and Gu Han meet?

82
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:09,160
Well,

83
00:06:09,680 --> 00:06:11,890
I took one of his major's electives,

84
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,980
and we got assigned to the same group.

85
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:16,280
How is he doing

86
00:06:16,300 --> 00:06:17,520
at school usually?

87
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,770
You mean...

88
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:21,640
I mean,

89
00:06:21,660 --> 00:06:23,180
is he happy?

90
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:25,460
Does he have anything bothering him?

91
00:06:27,740 --> 00:06:29,390
He rarely tells me these things.

92
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:31,200
You know how he is.

93
00:06:31,370 --> 00:06:32,630
With his personality,

94
00:06:32,690 --> 00:06:34,760
he doesn't open up easily to others.

95
00:06:35,990 --> 00:06:38,560
But I think he is doing well.

96
00:06:39,260 --> 00:06:41,640
He has teammates and classmates with him,

97
00:06:41,730 --> 00:06:42,760
and he is working hard

98
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:44,560
for what he likes.

99
00:06:46,990 --> 00:06:48,159
That's good.

100
00:06:53,960 --> 00:06:54,680
Ma'am,

101
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:56,380
actually,

102
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:58,600
this restaurant isn't far from school.

103
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,960
Why did you come to eat alone

104
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:03,010
without asking Senior to join you?

105
00:07:10,340 --> 00:07:11,100
I'm sorry.

106
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,760
Did I say something wrong?

107
00:07:15,050 --> 00:07:16,560
Actually, he and I

108
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:19,840
haven't had a meal together
for a long time.

109
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:22,760
I'm usually busy with business abroad,

110
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:23,520
and he

111
00:07:23,590 --> 00:07:25,650
is busy with his own things at school.

112
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,960
We don't even get together

113
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:29,560
on holidays sometimes.

114
00:07:35,030 --> 00:07:36,909
But fortunately, I met you today,

115
00:07:36,930 --> 00:07:38,440
and you chatted with me so much.

116
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,320
You know what,

117
00:07:39,340 --> 00:07:41,700
I feel like we really hit it off.

118
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,110
Me too.

119
00:07:45,500 --> 00:07:46,260
Ma'am.

120
00:07:46,810 --> 00:07:47,650
How about

121
00:07:48,330 --> 00:07:49,570
I ask Senior?

122
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,640
Are you free? Come have a meal.

123
00:07:59,490 --> 00:08:02,170
[Zhou Xiangxiang]

124
00:07:59,659 --> 00:08:01,320
Kunzhou time-honored brand.

125
00:08:09,930 --> 00:08:11,960
Li Sirui, Li Sirui.

126
00:08:11,960 --> 00:08:13,490
They don't look good at all.

127
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,860
What time is it?

128
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,200
Past twelve.

129
00:08:33,970 --> 00:08:36,830
What about the Water World Anime Expo
you promised?

130
00:08:38,190 --> 00:08:39,450
Have your drink first.

131
00:08:39,450 --> 00:08:40,200
I'm asking you.

132
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:42,260
Where is the anime? Where is the expo?

133
00:08:44,810 --> 00:08:45,840
Actually,

134
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,920
the Anime Expo is on 19th.

135
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:50,600
I bought the wrong one.

136
00:09:00,190 --> 00:09:01,120
Xiaotao.

137
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,200
Senior.

138
00:09:10,460 --> 00:09:11,600
This...

139
00:09:14,670 --> 00:09:15,680
Sit down.

140
00:09:15,850 --> 00:09:17,050
Why are you standing?

141
00:09:17,620 --> 00:09:18,560
Come.

142
00:09:21,010 --> 00:09:22,250
What a coincidence.

143
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,560
I was waiting for a table outside today,

144
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:25,690
and I happened to run into your mother.

145
00:09:27,110 --> 00:09:28,670
Han, honestly.

146
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:30,300
You should've properly introduced

147
00:09:30,300 --> 00:09:31,830
Xiangxiang to me last time.

148
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:39,780
Have you two been talking for a long time?

149
00:09:40,570 --> 00:09:42,040
Your mom is really friendly.

150
00:09:42,040 --> 00:09:44,100
She treated me to all this great food.

151
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,460
Xiangxiang is so sensible.

152
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:48,100
I'm so happy that our Gu Han

153
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:49,360
has a friend like you.

154
00:09:53,310 --> 00:09:54,440
Serve her some food.

155
00:09:55,050 --> 00:09:56,450
What are you waiting for?

156
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:05,980
Thank you.

157
00:10:10,100 --> 00:10:12,100
Have you been eating on time lately?

158
00:10:12,300 --> 00:10:13,740
I eat after basketball practice.

159
00:10:13,740 --> 00:10:15,240
How many times have I told you?

160
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,560
Don't overdo it in practice.

161
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:18,700
It's just a hobby.

162
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:19,520
I know.

163
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:20,760
Let's eat.

164
00:10:34,100 --> 00:10:35,020
Excuse me.

165
00:10:35,050 --> 00:10:36,910
We're running a pre‑Dragon‑Boat‑Festival
promotion today.

166
00:10:36,910 --> 00:10:38,180
Take a group photo of the whole table,

167
00:10:38,180 --> 00:10:39,840
have one person post it to Dianping,

168
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,570
and you can enjoy 10% discount.

169
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:45,130
I'll post it.

170
00:10:49,690 --> 00:10:51,420
Alright, let's take a picture.

171
00:10:56,060 --> 00:10:56,780
Senior.

172
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:10,970
Sir,

173
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,020
move a little closer

174
00:11:12,020 --> 00:11:13,410
to your mother and your girlfriend.

175
00:11:13,410 --> 00:11:14,770
I'm not his girlfriend.

176
00:11:26,350 --> 00:11:27,530
Come on, get ready.

177
00:11:28,050 --> 00:11:30,610
Three, two, one.

178
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:43,300
What did my mom talk to you about?

179
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:44,340
What?

180
00:11:46,880 --> 00:11:47,680
Like,

181
00:11:47,820 --> 00:11:49,020
things from the past.

182
00:11:55,440 --> 00:11:56,880
Does he have any

183
00:11:57,130 --> 00:12:00,130
really close friends from childhood?

184
00:12:00,380 --> 00:12:01,620
I don't recall any.

185
00:12:02,270 --> 00:12:04,430
Oh. When he was in a bad mood,

186
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:05,920
he would look at the photo behind the door

187
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,510
of him and the little girl next door.

188
00:12:07,510 --> 00:12:09,370
He would look at it for a long time.

189
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:10,920
They were really close.

190
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:16,220
A photo with the girl next door.

191
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:18,930
What's wrong?

192
00:12:27,220 --> 00:12:28,280
Xiaotao, wait a minute.

193
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:29,280
Just listen to me.

194
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,760
Stop following me.

195
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,200
I really didn't mean it.

196
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,520
I think even without the Anime Expo,

197
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:35,180
we can still play in the water.

198
00:12:35,450 --> 00:12:36,510
[Hurricane Bay]

199
00:12:39,630 --> 00:12:41,040
[Hurricane Bay]

200
00:12:41,980 --> 00:12:42,690
Stand there.

201
00:12:42,690 --> 00:12:44,190
Let me hit you, and I'll forgive you.

202
00:12:44,190 --> 00:12:45,850
Will you stop being mad after hitting me?

203
00:12:45,850 --> 00:12:46,850
What do you think?

204
00:12:47,730 --> 00:12:48,960
Fine, then hit me.

205
00:12:59,180 --> 00:13:00,640
Why aren't you hitting me?

206
00:13:00,640 --> 00:13:01,520
Hit me.

207
00:13:04,010 --> 00:13:04,920
Hit me.

208
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:06,640
Are you going to hit me or not?

209
00:13:18,930 --> 00:13:21,020
Le Xiaotao, I'll fight you!

210
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:22,120
Come on.

211
00:13:22,560 --> 00:13:23,560
Don't run.

212
00:13:28,350 --> 00:13:29,280
Come at me.

213
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,760
Loser.

214
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:46,530
-Get up. Get up.
-I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

215
00:13:54,950 --> 00:13:56,360
Funny?

216
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:02,180
You invited me on purpose today,
didn't you?

217
00:14:02,410 --> 00:14:03,810
Chen Yu and Kong Fang

218
00:14:03,830 --> 00:14:06,190
didn't even know about this, right?

219
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:09,010
How could that be?
What are you talking about?

220
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,700
I took a look.

221
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:12,600
These are two combo tickets.

222
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:14,320
There are only two in total.

223
00:14:18,580 --> 00:14:19,800
These two tickets

224
00:14:21,370 --> 00:14:22,970
were actually given by a fan.

225
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:25,600
I couldn't find anyone else,

226
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,120
so you lucked out.

227
00:14:33,100 --> 00:14:35,890
[2017 Freshman Enrollment]

228
00:14:35,820 --> 00:14:36,960
Le Xiaotao.

229
00:14:46,070 --> 00:14:47,520
Gloomy Rascal.

230
00:14:55,510 --> 00:14:56,910
Let me carry that for you.

231
00:14:58,640 --> 00:14:59,600
Thank you.

232
00:15:05,250 --> 00:15:07,600
Do you have anything to say to me?

233
00:15:16,430 --> 00:15:17,960
Nope. About what?

234
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:23,820
Then I'm leaving.

235
00:15:24,290 --> 00:15:25,400
What now?

236
00:15:26,210 --> 00:15:27,280
You turn cold as soon as the fun's over.

237
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:29,480
Who'd dare hang out with you after this?

238
00:15:29,610 --> 00:15:31,300
Isn't there someone else
to keep you company?

239
00:15:31,300 --> 00:15:32,230
What do you mean?

240
00:15:33,280 --> 00:15:34,160
Nothing.

241
00:15:47,180 --> 00:15:48,080
Xiaotao.

242
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,540
Why haven't you been
replying to my messages lately?

243
00:15:50,540 --> 00:15:52,200
I've been really busy,

244
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,660
must've forgotten to reply.

245
00:15:53,660 --> 00:15:54,520
Busy with what?

246
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:58,110
I recently met a senior.

247
00:15:58,140 --> 00:15:59,490
He's been studying with me.

248
00:15:59,490 --> 00:16:01,080
I think he's pretty nice.

249
00:16:01,810 --> 00:16:02,680
Alright.

250
00:16:03,810 --> 00:16:05,470
I've got things to do. See you.

251
00:16:09,110 --> 00:16:10,910
Did I say something wrong again?

252
00:16:11,070 --> 00:16:12,000
No.

253
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:15,400
Are you coming to watch the game?

254
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:16,240
No.

255
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:21,480
What did I say wrong this time?

256
00:16:24,070 --> 00:16:26,690
Our Xiangxiang has been promoted
to the team's family section.

257
00:16:26,690 --> 00:16:28,000
It's the bench.

258
00:16:28,020 --> 00:16:30,400
I'm the one filming the documentary, okay?

259
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:32,220
Then remember to give us in the crowd

260
00:16:32,220 --> 00:16:33,220
a few more shots tomorrow.

261
00:16:33,220 --> 00:16:34,360
No problem.

262
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:36,590
I promise they'll all be big close-ups.

263
00:16:36,610 --> 00:16:37,760
Okay.

264
00:16:39,170 --> 00:16:40,240
Xiaotao.

265
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,860
Are you really not going?

266
00:16:44,180 --> 00:16:45,820
I've got plans.

267
00:16:45,850 --> 00:16:46,650
I'm not going.

268
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:49,440
Then I'll show you the footage
after I shoot it.

269
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:55,080
This smells pretty good.

270
00:16:56,320 --> 00:16:57,080
Yeah.

271
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:31,850
Too stressed to sleep well?

272
00:17:32,040 --> 00:17:33,500
You even got dark circles.

273
00:17:33,800 --> 00:17:35,530
You're the one who's stressed.

274
00:17:36,020 --> 00:17:37,340
Why would I be stressed?

275
00:17:37,340 --> 00:17:40,340
Without me, you guys would've
lost into the play-ins.

276
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,880
How's your preparation?

277
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:44,280
Not bad.

278
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:47,530
Play smart.

279
00:17:47,560 --> 00:17:49,800
Don't let your emotions
get the better of you, got it?

280
00:17:49,800 --> 00:17:50,520
Got it.

281
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:06,720
Relax, don't be nervous.

282
00:18:11,840 --> 00:18:13,640
Good luck in the game, everyone.

283
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:14,680
Good luck.

284
00:18:15,080 --> 00:18:15,720
Good luck.

285
00:18:21,360 --> 00:18:22,240
Hello, Gu Han.

286
00:18:22,450 --> 00:18:24,600
We all know this match is crucial.

287
