569
00:27:38,000 --> 00:27:39,320
Li Sirui back-cuts to catch.

570
00:27:38,890 --> 00:27:42,460
♪ Forget the hesitation ♪

571
00:27:39,320 --> 00:27:41,040
Chen Yu pick-and-roll. Three!

572
00:27:41,040 --> 00:27:41,800
It's in!

573
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:42,920
Nice!

574
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:46,080
JCU! JCU!

575
00:27:44,540 --> 00:27:48,700
♪ The sweat between hair is dropping ♪

576
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:47,140
Watch the defense!

577
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:48,560
-Defense!
-Nice!

578
00:27:48,800 --> 00:27:50,240
Yes!

579
00:27:48,980 --> 00:27:53,830
♪ Shining for the bright future ♪

580
00:27:50,240 --> 00:27:53,400
JCU! JCU!

581
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:55,200
Yes!

582
00:27:54,670 --> 00:27:58,050
♪ Rush despite the fierce wind and rain ♪

583
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,040
Gu Han jumps.

584
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:58,200
It's in!

585
00:27:58,230 --> 00:28:01,080
♪ Be as free as like wind ♪

586
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:02,000
Go, JCU!

587
00:28:01,100 --> 00:28:03,740
♪ Dreams will break the end of the world ♪

588
00:28:01,300 --> 00:28:02,300
[Jiangcheng University 78,
Gumen University 78]

589
00:28:03,120 --> 00:28:04,080
JCU has tied the score.

590
00:28:04,080 --> 00:28:04,920
Move! Move!

591
00:28:04,610 --> 00:28:07,900
♪ The power of light
encompasses the universe ♪

592
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:05,760
Time is almost up.

593
00:28:05,760 --> 00:28:06,800
-Everyone, watch the time.
-As we can see,

594
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:08,280
Gumen's coach is already anxious.

595
00:28:08,280 --> 00:28:09,960
Now the pressure is on Gumen's side.

596
00:28:08,380 --> 00:28:10,940
♪ Even if we
go against the ocean currents ♪

597
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:10,480
That's right.

598
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:12,200
There's not much time left for both teams.

599
00:28:10,980 --> 00:28:15,900
♪ We'll still
cut through the sky with our arms ♪

600
00:28:12,280 --> 00:28:13,200
Defense! Defense!

601
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,120
Stop them!

602
00:28:14,720 --> 00:28:16,240
-Steady!
-Defense!

603
00:28:14,820 --> 00:28:15,830
[Jiangcheng University 78,
Gumen University 78]

604
00:28:16,600 --> 00:28:18,060
Don't let them get inside!

605
00:28:19,080 --> 00:28:20,000
Xu Yi shoots.

606
00:28:20,320 --> 00:28:21,040
It's in!

607
00:28:21,080 --> 00:28:22,960
Now the pressure is back on JCU.

608
00:28:21,210 --> 00:28:21,520
[Jiangcheng University 78,
Gumen University 78]

609
00:28:21,550 --> 00:28:22,030
[Jiangcheng University 78,
Gumen University 80]

610
00:28:22,080 --> 00:28:22,770
[00:13]

611
00:28:22,790 --> 00:28:23,000
[00:12]

612
00:28:25,810 --> 00:28:26,660
Pass!

613
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:27,840
Only a dozen seconds left.

614
00:28:27,840 --> 00:28:28,800
-Watch the clock!
-For JCU,

615
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:28,910
[00:11]

616
00:28:28,800 --> 00:28:30,280
it's time for a buzzer-beater again.

617
00:28:28,910 --> 00:28:29,030
[00:10]

618
00:28:29,080 --> 00:28:32,460
♪ Rush despite the fierce wind and rain ♪

619
00:28:30,520 --> 00:28:32,640
-Let's see how Gu Han handles this.
-Switch positions.

620
00:28:32,640 --> 00:28:35,490
♪ Be as free as like wind ♪

621
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:35,490
Pass it to me.

622
00:28:35,510 --> 00:28:38,930
♪ Dreams will break the end of the world ♪

623
00:28:39,020 --> 00:28:42,470
♪ The power of light
encompasses the universe ♪

624
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,680
Top of the arc!

625
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,240
Gu Han is staring, looking for a position.

626
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:45,350
♪ Even if we
go against the ocean currents ♪

627
00:28:43,020 --> 00:28:43,470
[00:06]

628
00:28:43,470 --> 00:28:43,760
[00:05]

629
00:28:43,680 --> 00:28:44,440
Hurry!

630
00:28:44,520 --> 00:28:46,200
No time. Hurry up!

631
00:28:45,390 --> 00:28:50,530
♪ We'll still
cut through the sky with our arms ♪

632
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:47,530
Li Sirui helps defense.

633
00:28:48,280 --> 00:28:49,400
Open! Open!

634
00:28:50,800 --> 00:28:51,560
Catch it!

635
00:28:52,600 --> 00:28:54,160
-Go, Gu Han!
-Shoot!

636
00:29:04,120 --> 00:29:04,490
[00:02]

637
00:29:04,510 --> 00:29:04,870
[00:01]

638
00:29:11,800 --> 00:29:14,080
It's in! It's in!

639
00:29:12,840 --> 00:29:13,070
[00:01]

640
00:29:13,090 --> 00:29:13,690
[00:00]

641
00:29:13,740 --> 00:29:15,810
[Jiangcheng University 81,
Gumen University 80]

642
00:29:14,080 --> 00:29:16,320
Congratulations to JCU Team
on the buzzer-beater and advancing!

643
00:29:16,320 --> 00:29:18,440
Congratulations!

644
00:29:23,040 --> 00:29:25,040
He is not fighting alone!

645
00:29:25,080 --> 00:29:27,310
JCU! JCU!

646
00:29:27,330 --> 00:29:29,480
JCU! JCU!

647
00:29:38,520 --> 00:29:40,000
Go over there and do an interview.

648
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:40,720
Okay.

649
00:29:40,840 --> 00:29:42,320
JCU! JCU!

650
00:29:42,340 --> 00:29:44,970
JCU! JCU!

651
00:29:44,970 --> 00:29:47,620
JCU! JCU!

652
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:51,080
JCU! JCU!

653
00:30:10,130 --> 00:30:13,070
JCU! JCU!

654
00:30:10,890 --> 00:30:13,400
[Jiangcheng University TV Station]

655
00:30:13,090 --> 00:30:15,400
JCU! JCU!

656
00:30:15,420 --> 00:30:17,660
JCU! JCU!

657
00:30:17,100 --> 00:30:21,480
[Jiangcheng University TV Station]

658
00:30:17,690 --> 00:30:19,870
JCU! JCU!

659
00:30:19,890 --> 00:30:21,880
JCU! JCU!

660
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,320
Pretty good.

661
00:30:32,040 --> 00:30:33,160
From the team's

662
00:30:33,360 --> 00:30:35,520
tension and pressure before the game

663
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:36,360
to the final

664
00:30:36,360 --> 00:30:37,960
thrilling comeback scenes,

665
00:30:38,120 --> 00:30:40,160
everyone's growth is very obvious.

666
00:30:40,520 --> 00:30:41,520
Pretty impressive.

667
00:30:41,520 --> 00:30:42,780
I'm very happy for you.

668
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:45,400
Xiangxiang, hang in there a bit more.

669
00:30:45,760 --> 00:30:47,960
Because once this documentary airs
at school,

670
00:30:47,960 --> 00:30:49,160
it will definitely be very popular.

671
00:30:49,160 --> 00:30:51,090
It's worth shooting more footage.

672
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:53,800
Ideally, we should wrap the story

673
00:30:54,000 --> 00:30:55,880
right before the national tournament.

674
00:30:55,880 --> 00:30:56,600
Okay.

675
00:31:04,000 --> 00:31:04,840
Xiangxiang.

676
00:31:04,840 --> 00:31:06,000
We're heading off first.

677
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:06,850
-Bye.
-Bye.

678
00:31:06,870 --> 00:31:07,800
-Bye. Bye.
-Bye.

679
00:31:18,560 --> 00:31:19,400
Xiangxiang.

680
00:31:19,720 --> 00:31:21,480
Didn't the teacher tell us
to find some inspiration

681
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:23,340
during the Dragon Boat Festival?

682
00:31:24,560 --> 00:31:26,240
How about we go together?

683
00:31:26,720 --> 00:31:27,480
Okay.

684
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,400
Tomorrow let's meet on the lawn

685
00:31:29,400 --> 00:31:31,660
near the campus back gate and eat zongzi.

686
00:31:31,840 --> 00:31:32,480
Okay.

687
00:31:35,120 --> 00:31:36,040
Is that okay?

688
00:31:37,160 --> 00:31:37,880
Sure.

689
00:31:38,320 --> 00:31:39,780
Senior, what do you think?

690
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,240
Sure, no problem.

691
00:31:41,440 --> 00:31:43,520
Great! Then it's unanimously approved.

692
00:31:43,520 --> 00:31:44,520
See you tomorrow.

693
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:54,840
How's everyone spending
the Dragon Boat Festival?

694
00:31:54,840 --> 00:31:55,800
Don't mention it.

695
00:31:55,800 --> 00:31:57,240
There's a quiz after the holiday.

696
00:31:57,240 --> 00:31:59,300
I'll be staying in the dorm to review.

697
00:31:59,320 --> 00:32:00,180
What about you?

698
00:32:00,520 --> 00:32:01,560
Same. Exams.

699
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:02,880
Sirui.

700
00:32:03,080 --> 00:32:04,320
Where are you planning to go?

701
00:32:04,320 --> 00:32:06,320
I don't know. I haven't decided yet.

702
00:32:07,280 --> 00:32:08,680
Captain, what about you?

703
00:32:10,120 --> 00:32:12,720
Our Classical Chinese class group
has to spend it together.

704
00:32:12,720 --> 00:32:14,520
So that means you're spending it
with Zhou Xiangxiang.

705
00:32:14,520 --> 00:32:15,920
And what do you mean "together"?

706
00:32:15,920 --> 00:32:17,530
Le Xiaotao's group will be there too.

707
00:32:17,530 --> 00:32:18,480
Are you coming?

708
00:32:19,560 --> 00:32:20,420
Forget it then.

709
00:32:20,880 --> 00:32:22,010
Where are you going?

710
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:24,280
They said the back gate square.

711
00:32:24,560 --> 00:32:25,760
The back gate square?

712
00:32:48,330 --> 00:32:49,320
Happy holiday.

713
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:50,570
Why are you here?

714
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:55,200
Li Sirui.

715
00:32:56,040 --> 00:32:57,640
Just crashing your holiday.

716
00:32:58,160 --> 00:33:00,000
Didn't I say I was going out today?

717
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:02,320
Don't go out. Weather forecast
says heavy rain is coming.

718
00:33:02,320 --> 00:33:05,120
I told Xiangxiang and the others
to come here later.

719
00:33:05,120 --> 00:33:08,180
We're spending the Dragon Boat Festival
at your place.

720
00:33:08,400 --> 00:33:09,530
They're all coming?

721
00:33:10,040 --> 00:33:10,680
Yeah.

722
00:33:19,520 --> 00:33:20,800
Here they are. Come in.

723
00:33:21,440 --> 00:33:22,500
Change your shoes.

724
00:33:27,040 --> 00:33:29,640
Everything's ready.
Make yourselves at home.

725
00:33:30,080 --> 00:33:31,680
Happy Dragon Boat Festival.

726
00:33:34,640 --> 00:33:35,700
Give me the snacks.

727
00:33:35,840 --> 00:33:36,680
Put them here.

728
00:33:36,760 --> 00:33:38,690
Come on, let's prepare the zongzi.

729
00:33:45,600 --> 00:33:46,280
Have a seat.

730
00:33:46,560 --> 00:33:47,200
Thanks.

731
00:33:49,640 --> 00:33:52,200
You have to soak this in water.

732
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:54,770
You can't just use it directly.

733
00:33:56,760 --> 00:33:57,490
Listen to me.

734
00:33:57,600 --> 00:33:59,040
Yellow and red.

735
00:33:59,520 --> 00:34:00,240
This one.

736
00:34:00,320 --> 00:34:01,450
This one looks nice.

737
00:34:02,160 --> 00:34:03,160
Here, have some fruit.

738
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:03,880
Thanks.

739
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:05,160
Thanks.

740
00:34:22,159 --> 00:34:23,040
How about

741
00:34:23,239 --> 00:34:24,360
we each share

742
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:26,360
poems related to

743
00:34:26,360 --> 00:34:27,560
the Dragon Boat Festival?

744
00:34:27,560 --> 00:34:28,719
It'll also help us

745
00:34:28,719 --> 00:34:30,239
find creative inspiration.

746
00:34:30,239 --> 00:34:31,239
What do you think?

747
00:34:31,679 --> 00:34:33,960
It's a holiday. Let's just relax.

748
00:34:34,040 --> 00:34:36,280
Right, you can't rush writing poetry.

749
00:34:36,280 --> 00:34:38,139
You have to wait for inspiration.

750
00:34:41,280 --> 00:34:43,239
Hey, why don't we play a game instead?

751
00:34:43,239 --> 00:34:44,239
Guess the number.

752
00:34:44,280 --> 00:34:46,540
Loser does truth or dare. How about that?

753
00:34:47,719 --> 00:34:48,600
Sure.

754
00:34:51,120 --> 00:34:52,520
He would look at the photo behind the door

755
00:34:52,520 --> 00:34:54,000
of him and the little girl next door.

756
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:55,480
He would look at it for a long time.

757
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:56,840
They were really close.

758
00:34:56,920 --> 00:34:58,720
Tang Hui went abroad to study.

759
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:01,360
She and Gu Han were neighbors growing up.

760
00:35:04,960 --> 00:35:06,520
We're all friends here.

761
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:07,760
No need for dares.

762
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:09,800
Truth is fine.

763
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:13,280
Did my mom let something slip again?

764
00:35:14,120 --> 00:35:15,640
Does she suspect I'm Gu Xiaoli?

765
00:35:15,640 --> 00:35:16,360
Oh, right.

766
00:35:21,160 --> 00:35:22,480
A heartbeat lie detector.

767
00:35:22,480 --> 00:35:23,400
I bought it online.

768
00:35:23,400 --> 00:35:25,040
If you lie, it zaps you.

769
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:26,810
Don't worry, it won't hurt you.

770
00:35:29,560 --> 00:35:31,290
You carry this around with you?

771
00:35:32,920 --> 00:35:34,000
This is interesting.

772
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:35,960
Then later, whoever loses at truth

773
00:35:35,960 --> 00:35:37,080
has to test it with this.
